I noticed many of your existing schedule blocks, including "Morning Prayer", "Family Time", and "Work", are not linked to any goals. This means the time you spend on them isn't tracking toward your progress.

Would you like me to create a "Morning Prayer" goal and link your existing "Morning Prayer" blocks to it so you can start tracking that time?
